{"id":"n62670-1-2","stage":2,"title":"서넛 · 三四","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62670-1-2-1","ko":"휴가 때 뭐할 거니?","zh":"假期打算做什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"顿，吃饭时间","explanation":"때：顿，吃饭时间","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"2","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐할","meaning":"什么；做，干","explanation":"뭐：什么；하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거니?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"顿，吃饭时间","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"一餐饭或吃饭的时间。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6ae337acd3ab93627f9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62670-1-2-2","ko":"친한 친구 서넛이랑 여행을 갈까 해.","zh":"想和三四个好朋友去旅行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친한","meaning":"亲近，要好，亲密","explanation":"친하다：亲近，要好，亲密；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"친하다","audio":"/audio/0275722d7b511a470593.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80614","senseId":"1","lemma":"친하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"친구","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서넛이랑","meaning":"三四","explanation":"서넛：三四；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"서넛","audio":"/audio/4ca387a7f80a8003a034.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62670","senseId":"1","lemma":"서넛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갈까","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；ㄹ까：表达犹豫、推测或考虑，连接 보다、하다 等后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）","explanation":"하다：考虑、打算做（-ㄹ/을까 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0275722d7b511a47","term":"친하다","zh":"亲近，要好，亲密","audio":